### Edit a draft dish (happy path)
PUT http://localhost:8080/restaurants/aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee/dishes/ffffffff-1111-2222-3333-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Truffle Risotto",
  "type": "main",
  "foodTags": ["vegetarian", "glutenFree"],
  "description": "Creamy risotto with black peper",
  "price": 25,
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/risotto.jpg"
}


###

### Edit with unknown type (should return 400)
PUT http://localhost:8080/restaurants/aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee/dishes/ffffffff-1111-2222-3333-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Mystery Dish",
  "type": "side",
  "foodTags": ["vegan"],
  "description": "???",
  "price": 10.00,
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/unknown.jpg"
}

###

### Edit when dish is not in DRAFT (domain throws → 409)
PUT http://localhost:8080/restaurants/aaaaaaaa-bbbb-cccc-dddd-eeeeeeeeeeee/dishes/ffffffff-1111-2222-3333-444444444444
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Already Live Dish",
  "type": "MAIN",
  "foodTags": ["VEGAN"],
  "description": "Should fail because it's published",
  "price": 19.99,
  "pictureUrl": "https://example.com/live.jpg"
}
